  "description": "Polaris destination consumers v1: per-vendor delivery success/failure rates, failure breakdown by error_class, retry and DLQ counters, plus delivery duration and rate-limit wait gauges. Panels reference `polaris_destination_*` metrics defined in packages/shared-destinations/src/metrics.ts. The $vendor variable picks one of the five v1 consumers (webhook-sink, meta-capi, tiktok, ga4, braze).",
  "editable": false,
  "fiscalYearStartMonth": 0,
  "graphTooltip": 0,
  "id": null,
  "links": [],
  "liveNow": false,
  "panels": [
    {
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 6, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 0 },
      "id": 1,
      "options": {
        "content": "# Polaris Destinations\n\nMetrics from `packages/shared-destinations/src/metrics.ts`, exposed at each destination consumer's `/metrics` endpoint.\n\n**error_class closed set** (per `packages/shared-destinations/src/db/delivery-records.ts`): `consent`, `identity`, `mapping`, `auth`, `rate_limit`, `transient`, `permanent`, `timeout`, `policy`. The failure breakdown panel splits by this label.\n\n**Per-vendor row.** The template variable `$vendor` selects one of `webhook-sink`, `meta-capi`, `tiktok`, `ga4`, `braze`. Pick `All` to see the fleet aggregate.\n\n**Known gaps** (P10-003):\n\n- `polaris_destination_delivery_duration_ms_last` is a **gauge** (last observation), not a histogram — panel shows `max` / `lastNotNull` as the best v1 signal. P10-002 owns the histogram migration.\n- DLQ growth is shown as a **rate** here; for a true backlog gauge, query the `polaris_dlq_records` table via the DLQ triage runbook (P10-006).",
        "mode": "markdown"
      },
      "pluginVersion": "11.4.0",
      "title": "About this dashboard",
      "type": "text"
    },
    {
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}" },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "color": { "mode": "palette-classic" },
          "custom": { "drawStyle": "line", "lineWidth": 1, "fillOpacity": 10 },
          "unit": "ops"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 12, "x": 0, "y": 6 },
      "id": 2,
      "options": {
        "legend": { "displayMode": "table", "placement": "right", "calcs": ["mean", "max"] },
        "tooltip": { "mode": "multi", "sort": "desc" }
      },
      "pluginVersion": "11.4.0",
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}" },
          "expr": "sum by (vendor) (rate(polaris_destination_events_delivered_total{vendor=~\"$vendor\", environment=\"$environment\"}[5m]))",
          "legendFormat": "{{vendor}} — delivered",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "title": "Delivery success rate per vendor (5m, ops)",
      "type": "timeseries"
    },
    {
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}" },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "color": { "mode": "thresholds" },
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              { "color": "red", "value": null },
              { "color": "yellow", "value": 0.95 },
              { "color": "green", "value": 0.99 }
            ]
          },
          "unit": "percentunit"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 12, "x": 12, "y": 6 },
      "id": 3,
      "options": {
        "colorMode": "background",
        "graphMode": "area",
        "justifyMode": "auto",
        "orientation": "horizontal",
        "reduceOptions": { "calcs": ["lastNotNull"], "fields": "", "values": false },
        "textMode": "auto",
        "wideLayout": true
      },
      "pluginVersion": "11.4.0",
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}" },
          "expr": "sum by (vendor) (rate(polaris_destination_events_delivered_total{vendor=~\"$vendor\", environment=\"$environment\"}[15m])) / (sum by (vendor) (rate(polaris_destination_events_delivered_total{vendor=~\"$vendor\", environment=\"$environment\"}[15m])) + sum by (vendor) (rate(polaris_destination_events_failed_total{vendor=~\"$vendor\", environment=\"$environment\"}[15m])))",
          "legendFormat": "{{vendor}}",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "title": "Delivery success ratio per vendor (15m)",
      "type": "stat"
    },
    {
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}" },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "color": { "mode": "palette-classic" },
          "custom": {
            "drawStyle": "line",
            "lineWidth": 1,
            "fillOpacity": 10,
            "stacking": { "mode": "normal" }
          },
          "unit": "ops"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "gridPos": { "h": 10, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 14 },
      "id": 4,
      "options": {
